; Test 04: block.  F1 on line 1, three lines down, F2, two lines down,
; COPY (menu 1 0), KILL (menu 1 1), FORGET (menu 1 4), SAVE.  Compared:
; file, dumps (block inverse).
; @source T t04_arr
; @est 5
; @expect tok t04_arr.bb2 04-block.expect
; @expect bak t04_arr.bb2.bak
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
key 4d
key 50
key 4d
key 4d
key 4d
key 51
key 4d
key 4d
dump marked
menu 1 0
dump copied
menu 1 1
dump killed
menu 1 4
menu 0 2
wait freq "Name to save file as"
freq ok
wait screen
menu 0 9
wait exit
